# A name bound to what the language's own code computes of names, with no call, stands for those names (#328): `named`
# binds the gap between the two levels (`first.db - second.db`) and the array of both (`[first, second]`) to names
# before it hands each to a step, and `written` writes each where its step is handed it. An operator is no occurrence
# and a name adds no arrow, so the two routes are one plan: each step takes the two levels, and no value of the body's
# own (`gap`, `both`) stands between them and the step.

route signal.named
step named/draw
step named/list

line entry > named call
line Level·first > named value
line Level·second > named value
line Level·first > named/draw value                  # `draw(gap)`, `let gap = first.db - second.db`
line Level·second > named/draw value
line Level·first > named/list value                  # `list(&both)`, `let both = [first, second]`
line Level·second > named/list value
line named/draw > Screen own
line named/list > Screen own

home Level·first named
home Level·second named

side entry left
side Screen right

route signal.written
step written/draw
step written/list

line entry > written call
line Level·first > written value
line Level·second > written value
line Level·first > written/draw value                # `draw(first.db - second.db)`
line Level·second > written/draw value
line Level·first > written/list value                # `list(&[first, second])`
line Level·second > written/list value
line written/draw > Screen own
line written/list > Screen own

home Level·first written
home Level·second written

side entry left
side Screen right

# `gathered` writes the vector of both levels out once (`vec![first, second]`): it stands for them, so the step that
# lists it takes the two levels.

route signal.gathered
step gathered/list

line entry > gathered call
line Level·first > gathered value
line Level·second > gathered value
line Level·first > gathered/list value               # `list(&both)`, `let both = vec![first, second]`
line Level·second > gathered/list value
line gathered/list > Screen own

home Level·first gathered
home Level·second gathered

side entry left
side Screen right
